{"about_the_game":"Super Foosball is an arcade inspired Foosball game. First player to score 5 goals will win. The game contains both a single and multiplayer mode.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note: The game does NOT have matchmaking. You must forward port 7777 to play with your friend. Only the person hosting has to do this.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keyboard + Mouse</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Q W E R to select a pole</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mouse movement to move poles</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hold left or right click and scroll to rotate characters</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Scroll to kick the ball</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keyboard only</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Q W E R to select pole</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Up / Down to move poles</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Left / Right to rotate characters</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Space to kick the ball</li></ul><br>This is a remake of an older game I created a few years ago. The previous game was a tech demo and I felt it deserved a bit of more polish.<br><br><br>Music : Racing Cars by @SuperSonicDash","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1231710?t=1583731011","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231710/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1583731011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231710/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1583731011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231710/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1583731011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Super Foosball is an arcade inspired Foosball game. First player to score 5 goals will win. The game contains both a single and multiplayer mode.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note: The game does